    {
      "id": "packages/protocol/src/cbor/decoder.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "decoder.ts",
      "description": "CBOR 解码器模块，实现 RFC 8949 严格子集的反序列化。导出 decodeCbor 函数作为公共入口，内部通过 CborReader 类递归解析 CBOR 字节流。支持无符号/负整数、字节串、文本串、数组、映射、布尔值、null 和浮点数。强制限制嵌套深度、容器长度和字节长度以防止恶意负载攻击。",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "typescript",
        "sizeLines": 168,
        "fileCategory": "code",
        "exports": ["decodeCbor"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/protocol/src/cbor/encoder.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "encoder.ts",
      "description": "CBOR 编码器模块，实现严格定长 RFC 8949 子集的序列化。导出 encodeCbor 函数作为公共入口，内部通过 CborWriter 类构建字节输出。支持整数、浮点数、字符串、字节串、数组、映射、布尔值和 null 的编码。检测循环引用、验证 Unicode 标量值、拒绝稀疏数组和 undefined 值。",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "typescript",
        "sizeLines": 216,
        "fileCategory": "code",
        "exports": ["encodeCbor"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/protocol/src/cbor/options.ts",
      "type": "file",
      "label": "options.ts",
      "description": "CBOR 编解码共享配置模块。定义 CborOptions/ResolvedCborOptions 接口、CborError 自定义错误类、TextEncoder/TextDecoder 单例，以及最大字节长度（16MB）、最大容器长度（100万）、最大嵌套深度（64）的安全默认值。提供 resolveOptions 函数解析并校验用户配置。",
      "metadata": {
        "language": "typescript",
        "sizeLines": 52,
        "fileCategory": "code",
        "exports": ["UINT32_BASE", "MAX_UINT32", "DEFAULT_MAX_CBOR_BYTE_LENGTH", "DEFAULT_MAX_CBOR_CONTAINER_LENGTH", "DEFAULT_MAX_CBOR_DEPTH", "CborError", "textEncoder", "textDecoder", "resolveOptions"]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/protocol/src/cbor/decoder.ts::CborReader",
      "type": "class",
      "label": "CborReader",
      "description": "CBOR 字节流递归读取器。维护字节缓冲区和偏移量，根据主要类型（major type 0-7）分发解析逻辑。通过 readItem 递归处理嵌套结构，readArgument 处理变长整数参数，readSimple 处理布尔/null/浮点值。强制嵌套深度和容器大小限制以防御畸形输入。",
      "metadata": {
        "file": "packages/protocol/src/cbor/decoder.ts",
        "methods": ["constructor", "decode", "readItem", "readSimple", "readLength", "readArgument", "readByte", "readBytes"],
        "startLine": 10,
        "endLine": 158
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "packages/protocol/src/cbor/encoder.ts::CborWriter",
      "type": "class",
      "label": "CborWriter",
      "description": "CBOR 字节流写入器，使用动态扩容的 Uint8Array 缓冲区。提供 writeByte/writeBytes/writeUint16/writeUint32/writeUint64/writeFloat64 等底层写入方法，以及 ensureCapacity 自动扩容机制。初始缓冲区 256 字节，按 2 倍增长且不超过 maxByteLength 上限。",
      "metadata": {
        "file": "packages/protocol/src/cbor/encoder.ts",
